# 17.15 Update `.gitignore`

Make sure you **do NOT upload** your dataset.

Your `.gitignore` should contain:

```gitignore
# Python
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Dataset
dataset/raw/
dataset/training/
dataset/processed/
dataset/test/
dataset/train/
dataset/validation/

# Node
node_modules/
client/node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/

# Build
client/dist/
frontend/dist/

# Python cache
.pytest_cache/

# Logs
*.log

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db